        "answer": "c",
        "explanation": "The request size is what the device sent, and 3,482,117 bytes is about 3.4 MB: a file or a very long paste, in a POST, to a site in the AI category, with action Allowed. Calling it a download reads the wrong field, because the response was only 2,214 bytes. It was not blocked: the action field says Allowed, and nothing in a category makes POST denied by default. It is not a page view, because a page view is a GET with a small request, and prompts are sent with POST."
