        "answer": "a",
        "explanation": "Of the five questions an analyst asks about an agent, the first three (who started the run, what the agent decided, what each tool touched) come from the trace, and whether the agent itself was changed comes from the platform's audit log. A trace is not deleted when a run ends: it is stored like any other telemetry. Tool steps are part of the trace as execute_tool spans, not part of an identity log. Nothing in the trace format encrypts spans with an agent key."
